WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,070 --> 00:00:02,190
Then we won't investigate

2
00:00:02,550 --> 00:00:04,470
These losers want to die before they run away for their lives

3
00:00:04,790 --> 00:00:05,990
Shen Ren is even more Bai Da

4
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:08,250
Return to Beijing and settle the general accounts of the Qing family

5
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:10,980
These people can't ask anything at all

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:12,660
So if you kill, just kill.

7
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:15,540
We can wait until we get back to talk about the bad guys.

8
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:21,300
Miss wants to see you and me

9
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:24,520
Does Miss You Er know?

10
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:26,200
Does your lady have anything to do with me?

11
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:27,600
I don't know either

12
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:29,120
You'll know when you go there

13
00:00:33,510 --> 00:00:35,630
Thank you for inviting me to tea, sir.

14
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:40,600
I don’t know why Miss Zifantie invited me here.

15
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:42,580
This gentleman saved my life

16
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:44,940
I would like to thank you for this invitation

17
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:47,020
Iron Girl Ji people have their own destiny

18
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:48,220
Even if it's rude

19
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:49,980
Presumably, it can also turn disaster into good fortune.

20
00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:51,820
Even if it is as the young master said

21
00:00:52,340 --> 00:00:53,420
But I escaped once

22
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:55,380
It might not be easy to hide the second time

23
00:00:57,460 --> 00:00:58,380
It's man-made

24
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:00,020
I believe in Iron Girl
